  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction he appears as one of Northern Plains’ five rank eight Gu Immortals, classed with Heavenly Lord Bai Zu as a lone cultivator in the neutral faction, neither righteous nor demonic.",
      "chapters": [
        749
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The earlier invitation round already groups him with Yao Huang and Old Ancestor Xue Hu among those rank eight seniors.",
      "chapters": [
        736
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yao_huang",
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His cultivation covers the five paths of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth, and he holds metal path Immortal Gu among that set. That spread lets him take reverse misfortune Immortal Gu with metal path Immortal Gu and materials, and later take Loner Hong Yu because that captive’s immortal aperture suits him.",
      "chapters": [
        761
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-and-cultivation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_reverse_misfortune",
        "char_loner_hong_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the auction he joins Yao Huang’s gathering as the lone cultivators’ representative.",
      "chapters": [
        764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-and-cultivation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Longevity Heaven’s Gu Immortals do not want fortune rivalling heaven Gu to fall into an outsider’s hands, but they are unable to make a move against Old Ancestor Xue Hu’s refinement because of one person, Five Elements Grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        1144
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "longevity-heaven-held-back",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He sneaks into Longevity Heaven to steal the heaven and earth luck true inheritance after stalling in his own advancement, then ends trapped inside the Immortal Gu House Calamity Luck Altar under the Eight Extremities.",
      "chapters": [
        1180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trapped-while-infiltrating-longevity-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "fac_eight_extremities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later summary states he sneaks in, is discovered, resists for a long time, and finally lowers his head and joins Longevity Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trapped-while-infiltrating-longevity-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge later names him Northern Plains’ rank eight lone immortal who cultivates formation path while mimicking metal, wood, water, fire, and earth, a formation path great grandmaster recruited by Longevity Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trapped-while-infiltrating-longevity-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Central Continent assault Bing Sai Chuan assigns him formation path work on a half-destroyed refinement path formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "trapped-while-infiltrating-longevity-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stands behind Fang Yuan against Duke Long and raises Five Elements Ring, an immortal formation condensed into a five colored ring that he calls his strongest defensive method. Duke Long breaks the ring, and a qi path killer move of purple-gold dragon qi bursts Five Elements Grandmaster into pieces on the spot.",
      "chapters": [
        1745
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    }
  ],
